     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 16pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">近日，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杭二中举办了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">智慧课堂</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学科节、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杭</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">十四</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中举办了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">双新</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学术节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">活动</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校作为省内名校均受邀参加。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杭二中学科节以</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">智慧点亮课堂</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> AI赋能未来</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">——</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">智能时代专家型学习者培养的实践探索</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为主题，以</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教师主题研修</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">AI+课堂主题展示</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人工智能专家报告</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为主要形式</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校英语组王维、政治组王青共</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">位老师参与了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">课堂主题展示</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王维老师执教了</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">《</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">express your opinion on sea exploration</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">》，她</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">借助AI，从</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">the inner voice of the sea</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">导入文本话题，并创设世界海洋日论坛演讲的情境，激发学生学习热情并明晰本节课的学习目标。通过精心设问，层层深入，引导学生绘制本文的思维导图，并理解议论文写作的框架和写作技巧。输出环节为学生演讲，发表对海洋探索的观点，帮助学生完成从输入到输出的转化，实现知识的迁移创新。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418141527.Jpeg" style="width: 3.751389in; height: 2.501389in" alt="202505261418149147.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">王青老师执教的《数智时代的文化发展：路径·自信·强国——铜雕文化的立圈·破圈·出圈》一课中，通过指导学生如何运用DeepSeek进行精确有效的搜索，带领学生借助人工智能软件找寻铜雕文化的破圈之法，让学生在活动中感悟优秀传统文化的传承与发展。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418140015.Png" style="width: 4.284028in; height: 2.714583in" alt="202505261418142206.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杭十四中学术节</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">研课程</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">·</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">构新态</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">·</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">育新人</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为主题，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚智共构学科育人新范式、融合共创双新实施新路径、同频共振核心素养新课堂</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为目标，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">同课异构</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专家</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">点评</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为主要形式</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我校物理组</span><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">丁雪艳</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、化学组韩韬、历史组杨炀共3位老师执教了公开课。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">丁雪艳老师执教的《带电粒子在电场中的运动（加速）》，从阴极射线管的实验出发，让学生感受到带电粒子经电场后加速获得能量，并从运动和力、功和能量变化的角度分析带电粒子在匀强电场和非匀强电场中的加速问题。从实际情况考虑，阴极射线管加速后的能量远远不能满足实际医疗等方面的研究，引导学生通过对加速装置的改装，把所学知识和生活实际紧密联系，极大地提高了学生学习物理的兴趣，也为后续的回旋加速器学习埋下了伏笔。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418146700.Jpeg" style="width: 3.781945in; height: 2.836806in" alt="202505261418141907.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">韩韬老师围绕高分子材料中的高吸水性树脂（SAP），跟随纸尿裤的发展历史，从SAP材料在不同时期的变革出发，讲述了SAP的基本要求和主流分类及对应的结构和制备方法。本堂课用学生生活中熟悉的物品作为载体，激发学生对日常生活中化学知识的兴趣和关注，让学生学会用理论知识赋予生活中的化学更多哲思和感悟。</span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418145653.Png" style="width: 3.840278in; height: 2.823611in" alt="202505261418147829.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杨炀老师的《一壶温酒煮春秋——绍兴黄酒视野下的中国近代变迁》，以绍兴黄酒为课堂线索，从民族危机、产业转型、投身革命、文化传承几个角度展开，梳理中国近代跌宕起伏的历史，以</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">物</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的视角揭示</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的境遇与</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">时代</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的脉搏，不仅宣传了绍兴的地方乡土文化，让近代史变得鲜活可感，更激发了对传统文化现代命运的深层思辨，呈现出一堂</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">有温度的历史课</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。 </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418144249.Jpeg" style="width: 4.722222in; height: 3.954167in" alt="202505261418147564.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次活动，我校也特邀浙江省仙居中学老师</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'sans-serif';font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">共同参与到这场知识与智慧碰撞的学术盛宴之中。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过两校教师学科研讨、教学交流的方式，开展联合教研活动，</span><span style="background: #FFFFFF;font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'sans-serif';font-size: 12pt;letter-spacing: 0;margin: 0;padding: 0;">旨在为县中教育的崛起注入新的活力与动力</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们相信，这种形式的学术交流和合作，必将会提高</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">两</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校教师的教学能力和专业水平，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">让教师们</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">更好地</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">立足课堂实践，不断探索新的教学方法和策略，为</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的高质量发展赋能。</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418142135.Png" style="width: 3.765972in; height: 2.825in" alt="202505261418147947.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418147682.Png" style="width: 3.833333in; height: 2.875695in" alt="202505261418148901.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\5\202505261418152226.Png" style="width: 3.802778in; height: 2.852083in" alt="202505261418151492.Png" /></span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
